---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---
{% from "sheet.njk" import sheet %}
{% set written = collections.written | reverse %}
{% set latest = written | first %}

<section class="intro">
  <p>Hey Ducklings, my name is Nox Knight. I'm a fictional character and this is my nightmare journal. Every weekday a new random nightmare will be posted for your night time terrors complete with a <a href="https://tagandtally.quest">Tag &amp; Tally</a> sentence and my therapeutic answers.</p>
</section>

{% if latest %}
  <p class="home-label">Latest</p>
  {{ sheet(latest.data, latest.templateContent, "h2", latest.url) }}

  {% set recent = written.slice(1, 8) %}
  {% if recent | length %}
    <section class="strips" aria-labelledby="recent-label">
      <p class="home-label" id="recent-label">Recently written</p>
      <ul class="strips__list">
        {% for n in recent %}
          <li class="strip hand--{{ n.data.hand }}">
            <a href="{{ n.url }}">
              <span class="strip__date">{{ n.data.night | longDate }}</span>
              <span class="strip__name">{{ n.data.title }}</span>
              <span class="strip__where">{{ n.data.notebookLabel }} · {{ n.data.pageLabel }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {% endif %}

  <nav class="home-links" aria-label="Reading">
    <a href="/notebook/01/001/">Start from the first page →</a>
  </nav>
{% else %}
  <p>Nothing here yet.</p>
{% endif %}
